WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:11.240
We are unfortunately potentially approaching
a very dangerous period, not ideologically,

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.790
but in a very sort of literal and and pragmatic
sense, a dangerous period, what could be dangerous

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.150
for many Americans?

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:28.160
Because President Donald Trump, in his latest
series of rage tweets, amplified a message

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.090
reportedly from one of his fans that things
are soon to escalate.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.890
And it could be a dangerous moment in America,
which, of course, is likely to have the effect

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.770
of planting that idea in his followers and
actually making it so a self-fulfilling prophecy

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.770
of sorts.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.100
So let me back up and kind of give you the
genesis of all of this yesterday morning after

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:52.159
a couple of days of relative calm on Twitter,
and I used that phrase very, very loosely.

00:00:52.159 --> 00:00:59.379
Donald Trump amplified some dangerous messages
and also sent some messages of his own, attacking

00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:02.949
Joe Biden, attacking Republican Governor Brian
Camp.

00:01:02.949 --> 00:01:08.530
And this now is getting to be extremely concerning
over what is going to be a five or six week

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.730
period of this nonsense.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:15.410
I predict it started with a sort of strange
all capital letters tweet where Donald Trump

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:19.750
said merely wisdom and courage, very strange
thing to say.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:26.060
And then he he quoted an unnamed fan, supposedly
from one of his rallies, as reported supposedly

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.360
by propaganda network own.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:33.240
And this is where Donald Trump amplifies the
idea of a dangerous moment with huge escalation,

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.080
saying, quote, and this is quote, quote, This
is me quoting Trump quoting and quoting a

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.710
Trump supporter.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:41.980
People are upset.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.340
They have a right to be.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:47.740
Georgia not only supported Trump in 2016,
but now that that's untrue.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:51.890
Of course, this is the only state in the Deep
South that went for Biden.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.670
Have they lost their minds?

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.460
And yeah, I mean, Biden won.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.460
That's it.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.930
This is going to escalate dramatically.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:04.550
This is a very dangerous moment in our history.

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:10.190
The fact that our country is being stolen,
a coup is taking place in front of our eyes

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:11.980
and the public can't take this anymore.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.230
Now, that's all untrue.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:20.970
And Trump quotes a Trump fan at a Georgia
rally, Parolin, and then says bad.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:25.050
After that, Donald Trump went after Republican
Georgia Governor Brian Kemp.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:26.050
Why?

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:29.010
Because Kemp won't illegally steal the election
for Trump.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.010
Kemp is no good guy.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:32.510
I really want people to understand this.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.990
When when I've been saying this week, Kemp
doesn't seem willing to try to steal Georgia

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:41.910
for Trump, I believe Kemp can be horrible.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:46.780
Kemp participated in voter suppression in
the very election in which he was a candidate

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:49.000
for governor against Stacey Abrams.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:54.580
Kemp has overseen the continued purging of
voter rolls and everything else that we've

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:55.830
been talking about.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:03:01.300
And I wouldn't even put it past Kemp to try
to steal Georgia if doing so would give Trump

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.480
the presidency.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:09.569
What what may be going on here is Kemp realizes,
even if I try to fraudulently steal Georgia

00:03:09.569 --> 00:03:12.820
for Trump, Trump still doesn't win.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:16.940
It just reduces the number of electoral votes
by which Joe Biden wins.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.800
And so, listen, Kemp's no good guy, but Trump's
furious with him because Kemp won't try to

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.270
steal it for him.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:28.510
Trump tweeting, How does Governor Brian Kemp
allow certification of votes without verifying

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.540
signatures?

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.330
And despite the recently released tape of
ballots being stuffed, remember that those

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.480
tapes have been completely debunked.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.500
His poll numbers have dropped like a rock.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.080
He is finished as governor.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:46.050
I have no I mean, listen, as we spoke about
yesterday with Benjamin Dixon, there's a lot

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:48.190
of Republican infighting in Georgia.

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:53.370
This may all damage in the end calculation
and the final math.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:57.350
This may hurt Brian Kemp or it may not with
Georgia Republicans, we don't know, but it's

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.810
certainly not clear at this time.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:05.350
And, of course, most of these tweets flagged
by Twitter as being misleading or disputed.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:10.510
And then Donald Trump merely calling on the
Supreme Court to steal the election for him,

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:17.110
saying, quote, The Supreme Court has a chance
to save our country, capitalist country from

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:23.889
the greatest capital election abuse in the
history of the United States.

00:04:23.889 --> 00:04:29.380
Seventy eight percent of the people feel,
no, the election was rigged.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:37.260
So when Trump chooses to quote and amplify
some alleged follower who's saying this is

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:43.580
about to escalate and this will become a dangerous
moment for the United States, it's very, very

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.210
dangerous for Trump to do.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.430
Now, Trump can hide behind.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.980
I didn't say it.

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.699
I was quoting a fan.

00:04:51.699 --> 00:04:54.650
But it's fanning the flames when the president
does this.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.890
It's dog whistling when the president does
this.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:59.930
And this could get very ugly very quick.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:05.630
And I have no idea what Trump supporters are
willing to do, what are they capable of as

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.050
they are inevitably seeing?

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.419
I mean, it's happening daily.

00:05:08.419 --> 00:05:11.740
Every lawsuit getting tossed each day.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.180
Trump continues to claim he won.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:19.560
And each day leads us to nothing other than
being one day closer to Joe Biden being sworn

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:22.190
in as president on January 20th.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.560
So it is scary.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:30.570
And I get emails, you know, two, three, four
emails a day, not dozens, like when I say

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.990
the wrong thing, but two, three, four emails
a day from people who are saying, listen,

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:36.320
I live in this red state.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:40.440
I'm worried about this or that because these
people are furious.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:44.639
These people literally believe the things
that Donald Trump is saying.

00:05:44.639 --> 00:05:50.130
They're not you know, they don't interpret
I was robbed as I should have won, but I didn't.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:53.050
They interpret I was robbed as specific.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:06:00.080
Democrats manipulated votes and stole and
cheated and hacked and all this different

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.080
stuff.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.470
And that the will of the people was that Donald
Trump would win.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.490
They literally believe that that's what Trump
is saying.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:10.820
And who knows what they're potentially willing
